  "implementation": [
    "Extend the independent serial reference with shared/external budget failures before/after result resize, release and retirement confirmation.",
    "After every transition, compare runnable/retained/queued owners, queued input bytes, exact lease phase and queue age, both budgets resident bytes and 25% candidate overhead. Failed/unknown ownership restores the full peak estimate.",
    "A failed release cannot free a waiting worker; ordinary release cannot erase uncertainty. Explicit successful confirmation returns the slot and acknowledges remaining owned bytes.",
    "Seventeen deterministic cases add running/computed failures, repeated failed confirmation, pending-peer admission and invalid fault-frontier refusal. Existing cancellation/reentrant resize/priority-aging schedules remain.",
    "The bounded CLI reports each of12frontiers separately, partial versus complete observed coverage, elapsed time and sampled heap within its existing120s/256MiBbudget."
